+      :=
+  FiniteChains.Comb.OrdCocycle.pointReading_end c a hc hm (f (FiniteChains.Davis.descendedSurfaceSimplex f hf c σ))
+    (FiniteChains.Davis.barycentricCoverReading f hf c σ)
